<!-- ABOUT -->
<div id="page-about" class="page">
  <div class="site-wrap"><div class="page-content">
    <div class="le-sec-head"><div class="le-sec-title">About the Corporation</div><div class="le-sec-num">Ref. LE-ABOUT-001</div></div>
    <div class="le-legal" style="border-left-color:var(--red);margin-bottom:2rem;">
      <div class="le-legal-head">Executive Summary</div>
      Luca Enterprise is a privately held, fully incorporated music entity operating across all known territories and several unknown ones. We specialize in the production, distribution, and legal ownership of <em>sound</em> — including but not limited to: heavy riffs, political statements disguised as choruses, and the uncomfortable silence between tracks.
    </div>
    <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:2rem;margin-bottom:3rem;">
      <div>
        <div class="le-legal-head" style="font-family:var(--mono);font-size:9px;letter-spacing:0.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink3);margin-bottom:1rem;">Our Philosophy</div>
        <p style="font-size:14px;color:var(--ink2);line-height:1.9;margin-bottom:1rem;">Our corporate philosophy is rooted in the belief that music is not merely an art form, but a <em>binding contractual obligation</em> between artist and listener. By pressing play, you have entered into an agreement with Luca Enterprise.</p>
        <p style="font-size:14px;color:var(--ink2);line-height:1.9;">We believe that volume is a form of communication, distortion is a form of honesty, and <span class="glitch">screaming is a strongly-worded memo.</span></p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="le-legal-head" style="font-family:var(--mono);font-size:9px;letter-spacing:0.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink3);margin-bottom:1rem;">Leadership</div>
        <div style="border:1px solid var(--border);background:var(--bg3);padding:1rem 1.2rem;margin-bottom:0.8rem;">
          <div style="font-family:var(--display);font-size:15px;font-weight:700;">L. Enterprise</div>
          <div style="font-family:var(--mono);font-size:9px;color:var(--ink3);letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-top:2px;">Chief Executive Officer / Founder / The Voice</div>
          <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--ink3);margin-top:6px;font-style:italic;">Whereabouts: Unknown. Availability: not accepted.</div>
        </div>
        <div style="border:1px solid var(--border);background:var(--bg3);padding:1rem 1.2rem;">
          <div style="font-family:var(--display);font-size:15px;font-weight:700;"><span class="redacted" onclick="this.classList.toggle('shown')">REDACTED</span></div>
          <div style="font-family:var(--mono);font-size:9px;color:var(--ink3);letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-top:2px;">Chief Compliance Officer</div>
          <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--ink3);margin-top:6px;font-style:italic;">Status: Compliant. Nature of compliance: unclear.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <hr class="le-divider">
    <div class="le-sec-head"><div class="le-sec-title">Press Releases</div><div class="le-sec-num">Official Statements Only</div></div>
